/* ==========================================================================
   Lifestyle Library — the library itself.

   THIS FILE IS THE LIBRARY. Nothing else has to change to add, remove or
   reorder a video or a whole row.

   A video is:
     id       the eleven characters after "v=" in a YouTube link
     slug     its address on this page, as /tool-kit-NEW/#slug
     title    what the card says
     by       who made it
     time     its length, as the player shows it
     note     the one line under the title
     img      a picture in /assets/tool-kit/, used before anything else
     cover    an Unsplash photo: { url, by, profile, photo }, hotlinked
     query    what to search Unsplash for, when a cover is still wanted
   Without img or cover a card falls back to YouTube's own thumbnail,
   which is a stopgap, not a resting place.

   `collection` groups videos inside a row (Qigong, Fascia). It is carried
   here so those can become rows of their own later; nothing reads it yet.
   `sources` keeps each channel's line tying it to the genetics report,
   for the same reason.
   ========================================================================== */
